      },
      {
        "language" : "th",
        "target" : "มีบางอย่างผิดพลาด โปรดลองอีกครั้งหรือไปที่บัญชี Apple ในการตั้งค่าเพื่อเปิดใช้งาน “ค้นหาของฉัน” จากที่นั่น",
        "filename" : "TNLLocalized.loctable"
      },
      {
        "language" : "ca",
        "target" : "Hi ha hagut un error. Torna‑ho a provar, o bé ves al compte d’Apple, a la configuració, i activa l’app Cerca des d’allà.",
        "filename" : "TNLLocalized.loctable"
      },
      {
        "language" : "te",
        "target" : "ఏదో తప్పు జరిగింది. దయచేసి మళ్ళీ ప్రయత్నించండి లేదా సెట్టింగ్స్‌లోని మీ Apple ఖాతాకు వెళ్ళి, అక్కడ నుండి Find Myను ఎనేబల్ చేయండి.",
        "filename" : "TNLLocalized.loctable"
      },
      {
        "language" : "id",
        "target" : "Ada yang salah. Coba lagi atau buka Akun Apple Anda di Pengaturan untuk mengaktifkan Lacak dari situ.",
        "filename" : "TNLLocalized.loctable"
      },
      {
        "language" : "sl",
        "target" : "Nekaj je šlo narobe. Poskusite znova ali pa v Nastavitvah odprite svoj račun Apple, da tam omogočite storitev Najdi.",
        "filename" : "TNLLocalized.loctable"
      },
      {
        "language" : "da",
        "target" : "Der er noget galt. Prøv igen, eller gå til din Apple-konto i Indstillinger for at slå Find til derfra.",
        "filename" : "TNLLocalized.loctable"
